  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eco-Tourism and Community Development in the Ibera Wetlands Proyecto eco turstico rural comunitario &quot;Canoa, remo y la huella del carpincho&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Civil &quot;La Choza&quot;- Centro de Iniciativas para el Desarrollo Local (La Choza) IAF Grant: US$280,900 Over three years La Choza will help 1500 individuals in the department of San Miguel, Corrientes, develop a source of income from ecotourism in and around the nearby wetlands constituting a protected area.</narrative>
  </description>
